<div class="privacy-container">
    @{
        ViewData["Title"] = "Privacy – AutoMatch";
    }

    <h1>Privacy – AutoMatch</h1>

    <section>
        <h2>1. Introduction</h2>
        <p>
            AutoMatch ("AutoMatch", "we", or "our") values the privacy and protection of its users' personal data.
            This Privacy Policy clearly and transparently explains how we collect, use, store, and protect your
            personal data when you use our website and services.
        </p>
        <p>
            By using the AutoMatch website, you accept the terms of this Privacy Policy. We recommend reading
            this document carefully and contacting us at
            <a href="mailto:automatchtest@gmail.com">automatchtest@gmail.com</a> if you have any questions.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>2. Personal Data Collected</h2>
        <p>We may collect different types of personal data, including:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Identification data:</strong> first name, last name, date of birth.</li>
            <li><strong>Contact data:</strong> email, phone number, address.</li>
            <li><strong>Account data:</strong> username, password (stored securely in encrypted form), and profile preferences.</li>
            <li><strong>Interaction data:</strong> vehicle listings viewed, submitted forms, messages sent through the platform.</li>
            <li><strong>Technical data:</strong> IP address, browser type and version, device used, visited pages, and access timestamps.</li>
            <li><strong>Cookies and similar technologies:</strong> information about how you use the website, for statistical and personalization purposes.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            Data may be provided directly by you (e.g., when creating an account or completing a form) or
            automatically collected while using the website.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>3. Purposes of Data Processing</h2>
        <p>The personal data collected by AutoMatch is used for the following purposes:</p>
        <ul>
            <li>Allow the creation, management, and authentication of your user account.</li>
            <li>Facilitate the use of the platform, including searching, publishing, and managing vehicle listings.</li>
            <li>Respond to contact, support, or information requests sent by you.</li>
            <li>Send communications related to the operation of the service (e.g., notifications regarding your account or listings).</li>
            <li>Improve website functionality, security, and user experience.</li>
            <li>Conduct statistical and performance analysis, aggregated and anonymized whenever possible.</li>
            <li>Comply with applicable legal and regulatory obligations.</li>
        </ul>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>4. Data Sharing with Third Parties</h2>
        <p>
            AutoMatch does not sell your personal data to third parties. However, in specific situations, your data
            may be shared with external entities strictly as necessary and in compliance with the law, such as:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li>
                <strong>Service providers:</strong> companies providing hosting, website maintenance, electronic communication,
                or statistical analysis services, always acting on behalf of AutoMatch and under our instructions.
            </li>
            <li>
                <strong>Public authorities:</strong> when required by law, court order, or competent authority, or to defend the
                rights of AutoMatch or third parties.
            </li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            In all cases, AutoMatch ensures that any third parties with whom data is shared provide adequate security and confidentiality guarantees.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>5. Cookies and Similar Technologies</h2>
        <p>
            Our website uses cookies and similar technologies to ensure proper functioning, enhance user experience,
            and collect statistical information about platform usage.
        </p>
        <p>We may use:</p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Strictly necessary cookies:</strong> essential for basic website operations and to enable core functionalities.</li>
            <li><strong>Performance and analytics cookies:</strong> used to analyze website usage and improve performance.</li>
            <li><strong>Functionality cookies:</strong> used to remember your preferences and personalize your experience.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            You may configure your browser at any time to block or remove cookies, although this may affect certain website functionalities.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>6. Data Security</h2>
        <p>
            AutoMatch implements appropriate technical and organizational measures to protect your personal data from
            unauthorized access, loss, destruction, alteration, or improper disclosure.
        </p>
        <p>
            Despite our efforts to guarantee the security of your information, no system is entirely invulnerable.
            Therefore, we cannot provide absolute security, but we commit to acting promptly and diligently in the
            event of a security incident involving personal data.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>7. Data Retention</h2>
        <p>
            Your personal data is retained only for the period strictly necessary to fulfill the purposes for which it
            was collected or to comply with applicable legal obligations.
        </p>
        <p>
            When no legitimate or legal need exists to retain the data, it will be securely deleted or anonymized.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>8. Users’ Rights</h2>
        <p>
            Under applicable data protection legislation, users have the following rights regarding their personal data:
        </p>
        <ul>
            <li><strong>Right of access:</strong> obtain confirmation and access to your processed data.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to rectification:</strong> request correction of inaccurate or incomplete data.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to erasure:</strong> request deletion of your data in legally permitted circumstances.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to restriction of processing:</strong> request limitation of processing in specific cases.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to object:</strong> object to data processing based on legitimate interests.</li>
            <li><strong>Right to data portability:</strong> receive your personal data in a structured, commonly used, machine-readable format and transmit it to another controller, when applicable.</li>
        </ul>
        <p>
            To exercise any of these rights, contact us at
            <a href="mailto:automatchtest@gmail.com">automatchtest@gmail.com</a>.
            Identity verification may be required to ensure the security of your request.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>9. Changes to this Privacy Policy</h2>
        <p>
            AutoMatch may update this Privacy Policy whenever necessary due to legal, regulatory, or service-related
            changes. Any modifications will be published on this page, along with the date of the latest update.
        </p>
        <p>
            We recommend checking this page regularly to stay informed about how we protect your personal data.
        </p>
    </section>

    <section>
        <h2>10. Contact</h2>
        <p>
            If you have any questions, comments, or requests related to this Privacy Policy or the processing of your
            personal data, you can contact AutoMatch via:
        </p>
        <p>
            <strong>Email:</strong> <a href="mailto:automatchtest@gmail.com">automatchtest@gmail.com</a>
        </p>
    </section>
</div>